# Real PostgreSQL transaction proof for the runtime fanout checkpoint protocol.
register_gate "tests/test_fanout_runtime_checkpoint_pg.py" "FANOUT RUNTIME CHECKPOINT POSTGRES GATE: PASS" "real-Postgres durable fanout runtime protocol" "against a bootstrapped schema and the real DeliveryStore/make_db_processor wiring: A commits and B typed-cancels into an attempt-neutral exact defer; retry restores the immutable all-repositories plan, skips A, and does not inventory twice; a lost slice COMMIT acknowledgement resolves the exact queued timestamp/reason and resumes only the remaining repository; a lost last-repository COMMIT acknowledgement resolves done with one handler run and no separate finish" "the production runtime and PostgreSQL authority APIs agree on plan/checkpoint/defer/finalize transaction boundaries under cancellation, retry, and lost acknowledgements" 24
